            </div></div></div><p>MOTORISTS could find themselves hot water after enjoying a couple of hot cross buns, according to a new video.</p>
<p>Just two of the Easter treats could give a false positive reading for alcohol in breath tests, even if the driver hasn&#8217;t touched a drop.</p>
